{"id":"n74135-1-8","stage":2,"title":"활동 · 活动","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74135-1-8-1","ko":"이 옷이 너무 불편해. 움직이기도 힘들어.","zh":"这件衣服太不舒服了，动起来都很费劲。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"옷이","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷이","audio":"/audio/4ed934dde6defcc6f810.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"불편해.","meaning":"不舒服，不适","explanation":"불편하다：不舒服，不适；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"불편하다","audio":"/audio/e3a81c369f5e123fbec0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71049","senseId":"2","lemma":"불편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불편해","audio":"/audio/9ef066a18068e6be3d1c.mp3"}},{"text":"움직이기도","meaning":"动，移动，动弹","explanation":"움직이다：动，移动，动弹；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"움직이다","audio":"/audio/05377c221a1ec6760c83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58166","senseId":"1","lemma":"움직이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"움직이기도","audio":"/audio/8223e33bb50d6736de7e.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들어.","meaning":"难，困难，费劲，难以","explanation":"힘들다：难，困难，费劲，难以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들어","audio":"/audio/42a96966a9378057f47c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"e3a81c369f5e123f","term":"불편하다","zh":"不舒服，不适","audio":"/audio/e3a81c369f5e123fbec0.mp3","entryId":"71049","definition":"身体或心理欠佳，难受。","pronunciation":["불편하다"]},{"id":"05377c221a1ec676","term":"움직이다","zh":"动，移动，动弹","audio":"/audio/05377c221a1ec6760c83.mp3","entryId":"58166","definition":"变换位置或姿势；或指使位置或姿势发生变化。","pronunciation":["움지기다"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"难，困难，费劲，难以","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"做某事不简单或不容易。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3cbd32408fcb3561b607.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74135-1-8-2","ko":"그럼 활동이 편한 옷으로 갈아입어.","zh":"那就换件方便活动的衣服吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"활동이","meaning":"活动","explanation":"활동：活动；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"활동","audio":"/audio/d4b47a5cf76094e95719.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74135","senseId":"1","lemma":"활동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"활동이","audio":"/audio/2fb230f28d528c1ac9af.mp3"}},{"text":"편한","meaning":"方便","explanation":"편하다：方便；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"2","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편한","audio":"/audio/1fefca8bff3d77728020.mp3"}},{"text":"옷으로","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷으로","audio":"/audio/a111d54bc7b0811baaba.mp3"}},{"text":"갈아입어.","meaning":"换，换穿","explanation":"갈아입다：换，换穿；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"갈아입다","audio":"/audio/83e13541ecbec8ff35d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53830","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈아입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈아입어","audio":"/audio/74bf01221ba64b071544.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"d4b47a5cf76094e9","term":"활동","zh":"活动","audio":"/audio/d4b47a5cf76094e95719.mp3","entryId":"74135","definition":"活动身体。","pronunciation":["활똥"]},{"id":"33bf1e37d2739b22","term":"편하다","zh":"方便","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3","entryId":"71334","definition":"容易而简便。","pronunciation":["편하다"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"83e13541ecbec8ff","term":"갈아입다","zh":"换，换穿","audio":"/audio/83e13541ecbec8ff35d7.mp3","entryId":"53830","definition":"把身上的衣服脱掉，改穿别的衣服。","pronunciation":["가라입따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1dc1d4cca793cd13dc09.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.9,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=7